<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Phase 4 Best in Slot Gear list for Marksmanship Hunter DPS in Wrath of the Lich King Classic. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Icecrown Citadel. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="when-to-switch-to-marksmanship">When To Switch to Marksmanship</h2>When to switch from Survival to Marksmanship is a hot topic in Phase 4 and it is not a simple and straightforward timeline for every single player. There are many factors to consider and it will differ from person to person on when the optimal time to switch is. <br/>
<br/>Assuming your guild does not need you to play Survival for <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=57669/replenishment">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_magic_managain.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Replenishment</span></a>, then from a gear perspective you will want the following gear at a bare minimum before you swap: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50733/falinrush-defender-of-quelthalas">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_crossbow_38.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fal'inrush, Defender of Quel'thalas</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51286/sanctified-ahnkahar-blood-hunters-headpiece">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_158.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Ahn'Kahar Blood Hunter's Headpiece</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51288/sanctified-ahnkahar-blood-hunters-spaulders">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_113.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Ahn'Kahar Blood Hunter's Spaulders</span></a>, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50402/ashen-band-of-endless-vengeance">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_81.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ashen Band of Endless Vengeance</span></a>. From there you will need to sim your own personal raid situation and gear to make sure it is in fact a dps increase to switch to Marksmanship.<hr/>
<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">Best in Slot Gear for Marksmanship Hunter DPS Phase 4</h2>
<ol>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Hit - Aim for 8% Hit Rating. In Phase 4 full BiS 3% of your hit rating will be covered by <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=53622/focused-aim">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_hunter_focusedaim.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Focused Aim</span></a>. As alliance only 2/<wbr/>3 <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=53622/focused-aim">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_hunter_focusedaim.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Focused Aim</span></a> will be necessary as the additional 1% from <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=6562/heroic-presence">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_21.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heroic Presence</span></a> if you are Draenei will bring you to hit cap.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Agility - Agility will increase your ranged attack power and critical strike rating.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Critical Strike Rating - Critical Strike Rating will increase your chance to land a critical hit.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Attack Power - Attack Power simply increases the damage done by abilities utilizing attack power in the formula.</div></li></ol>
