<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Frost for Marksmanship Hunter DPS Phase 4</h3>In phase 4 you will want to focus your <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=341/emblem-of-frost">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></span></a> on the 251 item level Tier 10 set first as the pieces are required to upgrade to the 264 item level and then 277 item level sets. <br/>
<br/>It is worth noting that your first two pieces of Tier 10 that you purchase are highly situational on your own current gear set as 2p Tier 9 and 2p Tier 10 is actually better than 4p T10 (264iLvl). Your ideal two pieces of Tier 10 to purchase with <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=341/emblem-of-frost">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></span></a> are the Chest/<wbr/>helm or Chest/<wbr/>shoulders. You will continue to use 2 pieces of T9 gear until you have 3/<wbr/>4 pieces of 277iLvl Tier 10 and depending on the rest of your gearset, therefore it is recommended you always sim your own personal setup. <br/>
<br/>There is only one item really worth buying with <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=341/emblem-of-frost">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></span></a> afterwards and even then it is situational on whether or not you acquired <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47546/sylvanas-cunning">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sylvanas' Cunning</span></a>/<wbr/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47545/vereesas-dexterity">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vereesa's Dexterity</span></a> in Phase 3. <br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50470/recovered-scarlet-onslaught-cape">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_14.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Recovered Scarlet Onslaught Cape</span></a> is a great cloak and will be quick to obtain. Assuming your guild stops running <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a> in Phase 4 and you were unlucky then this will be your best option. <br/>
<br/>The rest of the gear options purchasable with <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=341/emblem-of-frost">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></span></a> are situational on your own personal gear at the time.<br/>
