<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="chest">Chest for Marksmanship Hunter DPS Phase 4</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51289/sanctified-ahnkahar-blood-hunters-tunic">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_mail_11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Ahn'Kahar Blood Hunter's Tunic</span></a> is the best option chest option followed by the non heroic version <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51150/sanctified-ahnkahar-blood-hunters-tunic">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_mail_11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Ahn'Kahar Blood Hunter's Tunic</span></a>. All of the alternatives should be relatively free pickups with no competition while you wait for your <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51289/sanctified-ahnkahar-blood-hunters-tunic">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_mail_11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Ahn'Kahar Blood Hunter's Tunic</span></a> so pick whichever drops first as all of the options are an upgrade over Phase 3 BiS. <br/>
