<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="hands">Hands for Marksmanship Hunter DPS Phase 4</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51285/sanctified-ahnkahar-blood-hunters-handguards">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_84.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Ahn'Kahar Blood Hunter's Handguards</span></a> is the best option and finishes off the Tier 10.5 4 piece set bonus. Just like all other Tier gear slots the non-heroic <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51154/sanctified-ahnkahar-blood-hunters-handguards">
