<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="legs">Legs for Marksmanship Hunter DPS Phase 4</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50645/leggings-of-northern-lights">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_mail_32.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of Northern Lights</span></a> are the best option and the one gear slot that you will not use Tier 10/<wbr/>10.5 for. All listed alternatives are a direct upgrade from Phase 3 so pick whichever pair drops while waiting for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50645/leggings-of-northern-lights">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_mail_32.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of Northern Lights</span></a> assuming you won't lose priority on them.<br/>
<br/>For a hit rating option you can look at <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50697/gangrenous-leggings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_leather_34.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gangrenous Leggings</span></a>. They provide a whopping 98 hit rating so these will cover a large portion of your hit rating allowing you to gear up easier in other gear slots without having to worry about hit cap. <br/>
<br/>It is important to note that the gem <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40150/deft-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Deft Ametrine</span></a> in the leg slot is not a mistake, however it should only be used once full best in slot is obtained. In full best in slot gear you will be critical strike capped therefore making any additional crit wasted. Until that time however, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40147/deadly-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Deadly Ametrine</span></a> will be the better choice. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Leg Armor:</b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=38374/icescale-leg-armor">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_33.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Icescale Leg Armor</span></a>
