<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="feet">Feet for Marksmanship Hunter DPS Phase 4</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50607/frostbitten-fur-boots">
