<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="neck">Neck for Marksmanship Hunter DPS Phase 4</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50633/sindragosas-cruel-claw">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_monsterhorn_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sindragosa's Cruel Claw</span></a> is the best Phase 4 option followed by the non-heroic version <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50421/sindragosas-cruel-claw">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_monsterhorn_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sindragosa's Cruel Claw</span></a>. This neck will be quite contested so you can look at picking up <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51822/rimetooth-pendant">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_amulet_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rimetooth Pendant</span></a> from 10man <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=36853/sindragosa">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sindragosa</span></a> instead. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51890/preciouss-putrid-collar">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_78.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Precious's Putrid Collar</span></a> is a pretty decent loss in dps over <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50633/sindragosas-cruel-claw">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_monsterhorn_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sindragosa's Cruel Claw</span></a> but if you need the hit rating and have been unlucky picking up hit in other gear slots this can be a good temporary item to use. <br/>
<br/>If you are a new hunter in Phase 4 and have the gold for it you can purchase <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50452/wodins-lucky-necklace">
