<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="rings">Rings for Marksmanship Hunter DPS Phase 4</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50402/ashen-band-of-endless-vengeance">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_81.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ashen Band of Endless Vengeance</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50618/frostbrood-sapphire-ring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownringa.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Frostbrood Sapphire Ring</span></a> are the new best in slot rings for Phase 4. Luckily <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50402/ashen-band-of-endless-vengeance">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_81.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ashen Band of Endless Vengeance</span></a> will be a free pickup and rather quick to acquire as you can farm <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/faction=1156/the-ashen-verdict">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Ashen Verdict</span></a> reputation on trash mobs in <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50618/frostbrood-sapphire-ring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownringa.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Frostbrood Sapphire Ring</span></a> on the other hand will be another highly contested piece of gear so you will more than likely need to look at alternatives. There are a handful of good alternatives and all are relatively close to each other in terms of dps downgrade from <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50618/frostbrood-sapphire-ring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownringa.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Frostbrood Sapphire Ring</span></a> so pick whichever is available to you and drops first. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50604/band-of-the-bone-colossus">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_83.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Band of the Bone Colossus</span></a> is a decent hit option should you need the hit rating.<div class="pad"></div>
<table class="grid max-width">
