<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="guns-and-bows-for-marksmanship-hunter-dps-phase-4">Guns and Bows for Marksmanship Hunter DPS Phase 4</h4>Finally we have the ranged slot. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50733/falinrush-defender-of-quelthalas">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_crossbow_38.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fal'inrush, Defender of Quel'thalas</span></a> is miles ahead of any other option available to you in Phase 4 but is locked behind 25man Heroic Lich King. Your next best option is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50638/zods-repeating-longbow">
