<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_crossbow_38.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Windrunner's Heartseeker</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>Assuming your guild can at least kill <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=36855/lady-deathwhisper">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Lady Deathwhisper</span></a> on heroic I would pick up this bow as it is quite a bit better than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51940/windrunners-heartseeker">
